  "subject": "A Sham Shui Po candle maker is asked by a young man for one taper that burns exactly three minutes forty seconds, the length of the song he will propose to, and spends the night dipping and timing twelve test candles with a stopwatch until the thirteenth is right.",
  "caption": "Cantonese enka-influenced cinematic string ballad, slow and measured. Full string section with sustained cellos and violins, solo piano playing slow broken chords, French horn answering the vocal line, tremolo violin swells and a soft timpani roll at the chorus. Wide cinematic film-score recording, warm hall reverb, intimate close piano. Male baritone, dark and steady, restrained vibrato and enka-style kobushi turns on held notes, clearly sung melody on every line. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 64 BPM, A minor. Hushed, patient, tender. No drums kit groove, no synth pads, no autotune, no rap, no electric guitar, no uptempo section.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n深水埗後巷 我做蠟燭三十年\n今晚有個後生 企喺鋪頭門口\n佢話要一支 啱啱好燒三分四十\n唔多一秒 唔少一秒\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我問佢 點解咁嚴\n佢話 一首歌嘅長度\n\n[Chorus]\n蠟燭燒到最後一滴\n要同首歌 一齊停\n我浸多一次 又浸多一次\n點著佢 等佢行完\n\n[Verse]\n第一支燒咗三分十秒\n太短 我將燭芯換幼\n第二支燒咗四分半\n太長 我又換返粗\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n十二支喺枱面 排成一行\n我個秒錶 都唔夠用\n\n[Chorus]\n蠟燭燒到最後一滴\n要同首歌 一齊停\n我浸多一次 又浸多一次\n半夜三點 點著佢\n\n[Verse]\n第十三支 燒到最後一個音\n火苗跳一跳 就熄咗\n我企喺度 手都震\n好似自己 要去求婚\n\n[Bridge]\n我老婆企喺後面睇過\n話當年 我淨係送過一枝\n點到天光 都未燒完\n\n[Chorus]\n蠟燭燒到最後一滴\n要同首歌 一齊停\n後生仔 你嘅秒鐘\n我已經 幫你點好\n\n[Outro]\n三分四十秒\n慢慢燒 慢慢燒",
